e Bound Tides. Food, coin and supplies run down, and word on the road is that somebody is worth money to somebody. It is on its way. I will post here the hour it is out. What kind of game it is A narrativ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T12:01:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929387","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4589130-1830163047269390","game_id":"steam-4589130","kind":"announcement","title":"Dravora is now available to wishlist on Steam","summary":"Dravora is a narrative dark fantasy roguelite about leading a party of desperate people across a politically fractured medieval continent. Every interaction is a choice made in words. Every choice has consequences you live with.Releases November 17, 2026.What Dravora IsNo combat screens. No stat sheets. No skill trees. Just choices — and the weight of them. Your companions have their own values. Your character's identity emerges from what you do when the answers aren't clear. Your supplies dwind","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-21T19:46:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047269390","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4589130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4589130":"2026-10-26T12:54:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4589130":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:37Z"},"5332020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:54:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26